FlexUltra build adaptation:
  - FLEX is built as a private arm64/arm64e dylib and packaged at
    /var/jb/usr/lib/flexultra/libFLEX.dylib by the rootless package.
  - The private runtime removes FlexUltra's package-time dependency on an
    externally configured libflex repository while preserving FLEX execution
    inside each injected target process.
